msgctxt "300"
msgid ""
"Hello, I'm Koji, one of the staff members here. Remember?\r\n"
"In any case, I look forward to working with you again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "312"
msgid "Yeah, same here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "324"
msgid ""
"Well, the time has come to recruit a new hostess. I'm sure\r\n"
"there are still highly qualified young ladies out there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "336"
msgid "I'll be leaving it to you, Kiryu-san!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "360"
msgid ""
"Hello, I'm Koji, one of the staff members here. It's truly a\r\n"
"pleasure to meet you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "372"
msgid "Likewise. I'm Kiryu."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "384"
msgid ""
"I'll be assisting you going forward, Kiryu-san. Now, let's\r\n"
"recruit a new hostess."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "396"
msgid "Okay. What should we do first?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "408"
msgid ""
"Simple. All you need to do is look for charming girls in\r\n"
"Downtown Ryukyu and approach them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "420"
msgid ""
"I'm sure at least some of them are qualified to work here.\r\n"
"Kiryu-san, if you see someone who's a good fit, please bring\r\n"
"her over to the club."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "432"
msgid ""
"We only have room for one extra staff member, so please make\r\n"
"sure you bring someone who genuinely interests you.\r\n"
"Well, I'll be leaving it to you! Thank you for your help!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "456"
msgid ""
"I'll leave her coordination to you, then. Feel free to\r\n"
"customize her clothing and makeup as you see fit."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "468"
msgid ""
"You might not have a lot of outfits to choose from at first,\r\n"
"but more will come in time. That way you can be more\r\n"
"flexible when you coordinate your hostess's ensemble."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "480"
msgid ""
"Now, it goes without saying that clothes and accessories\r\n"
"cost money. Some of them can get quite expensive..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "492"
msgid ""
"So you'll have to make do with whatever we've earned so far.\r\n"
"Gotta make money to spend money, as you may know."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "504"
msgid "Now let's hit the dressing room!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "528"
msgid "We did it! We brought up another number one hostess!"
msgstr "Ce l'abbiamo fatta! Abbiamo creato un'altra hostess numero uno!"

msgctxt "540"
msgid ""
"I expected nothing less from you, Kiryu-san. I believe our\r\n"
"manager wishes to speak with you as well. Let's see what he\r\n"
"has to say!"
msgstr ""
"Non mi aspettavo niente di meno da lei, Akiyama-san. Credo che anche il "
"nostro manager desideri parlarle. Vediamo cosa ha da dire!"

msgctxt "564"
msgid ""
"Kiryu-san, you've become quite the expert. Maybe you\r\n"
"wouldn't mind coaching me a little sometime! Ahahaha."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "576"
msgid ""
"Let's be serious for a moment. We're aiming to turn an\r\n"
"amateur into a goddess here, no matter what it takes!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "588"
msgid "I believe in you, Kiryu-san, so let's get to it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "612"
msgid ""
"The way things work around here is: our girls go out onto\r\n"
"the floor a total of three times to serve customers."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "624"
msgid ""
"Each service is followed by a break period. During that\r\n"
"time, you can train your hostess of choice and coordinate\r\n"
"their appearance."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "636"
msgid "I'll explain training another time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "660"
msgid "Between each service round, you can conduct training."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "672"
msgid ""
"Training allows you to improve the service stats of the\r\n"
"hostesses, so it's important to train consistently."
msgstr ""
"L'addestramento permette di migliorare le statistiche di servizio delle "
"hostess, quindi è importante farlo con costanza."

msgctxt "684"
msgid ""
"Looks, Smarts, and Charisma, as well as Motivation and\r\n"
"Stress, can be affected by training. All are important\r\n"
"factors when taking customer service into account."
msgstr ""
"Aspetto, Intelligenza e Carisma, così come Motivazione e Stress, possono "
"essere influenzati dall'addestramento. Sono tutti fattori importanti ai fini"
" del servizio clienti."

msgctxt "696"
msgid ""
"Some customers may pay more attention to these subtle\r\n"
"details as opposed to what outfit she's wearing. After all,\r\n"
"it's what's on the inside that counts!"
msgstr ""
"Alcuni clienti potrebbero prestare più attenzione a questi sottili dettagli "
"piuttosto che all'outfit che indossa. Dopotutto, è quello che c'è dentro che"
" conta!"

msgctxt "708"
msgid ""
"However, please be aware that excessive training will make a\r\n"
"hostess stressed out."
msgstr ""
"Tuttavia, tenga presente che un addestramento eccessivo stresserà l'hostess."

msgctxt "720"
msgid "This can be remedied by having a hostess rest during break."
msgstr "Si può rimediare facendo riposare l'hostess durante la pausa."

msgctxt "732"
msgid ""
"Use both coordination and training to cultivate an excellent\r\n"
"hostess. Remember, we're aiming for the top here!"
msgstr ""
"Usi sia il look che l'addestramento per formare un'hostess eccellente. "
"Ricordi, qui puntiamo in alto!"

msgctxt "744"
msgid "Now, let's give training a try!"
msgstr "Ora, proviamo l'addestramento!"

msgctxt "768"
msgid ""
"Kiryu-san, now that you've gotten the hang of training,\r\n"
"let's open up a couple more training options here..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "780"
msgid ""
"The following three options will allow you to balance a\r\n"
"hostess's Stress and Motivation, improving their overall condition."
msgstr ""
"Le tre opzioni seguenti le permetteranno di bilanciare lo Stress e la "
"Motivazione di un'hostess, migliorando la sua condizione generale."

msgctxt "792"
msgid ""
"\"Lecture\" allows you to motivate a hostess. It also has a\r\n"
"slight beneficial effect on other statistics, but at the cost of\r\n"
"greatly increasing Stress."
msgstr ""
"L'opzione \"Lezione\" le permette di spronare un'hostess. Ha anche un "
"leggero effetto benefico su altre statistiche, ma al costo di un notevole "
"aumento dello Stress."

msgctxt "804"
msgid ""
"\"Relax\" lets a hostess take some time off for herself.\r\n"
"This is good for when you need to lower her Stress."
msgstr ""
"\"Relax\" permette a un'hostess di prendersi un po' di tempo per sé. È utile"
" quando ha bisogno di abbassare il suo Stress."

msgctxt "816"
msgid ""
"\"Encourage\" raises a hostess's Motivation without increasing\r\n"
"Stress. I mean, who doesn't like a compliment, right?"
msgstr ""
"\"Incoraggia\" aumenta la Motivazione di un'hostess senza aumentare lo "
"Stress. Insomma, a chi non piace un complimento, giusto?"

msgctxt "828"
msgid ""
"Use these training options wisely to get your hostess in\r\n"
"prime condition."
msgstr ""
"Usi queste opzioni di addestramento con saggezza per portare la sua hostess "
"in condizioni ottimali."

msgctxt "864"
msgid "Everybody's dressing up for the cosplay event we're hosting!"
msgstr ""
"Tutte si stanno travestendo per l'evento cosplay che stiamo organizzando!"

msgctxt "876"
msgid ""
"%s-san, please select a costume of your choice.\r\n"
"Can't wait to see what you come up with!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "900"
msgid ""
"Kiryu-san, we've received something new for the wardrobe.\r\n"
"I haven't had the chance to check out what it is, so..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "912"
msgid "Please be sure to take a look whenever you can."
msgstr "Ci dia un'occhiata appena può, per favore."

msgctxt "948"
msgid "Kiryu-san... I noticed that %s-san's rank went down..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "960"
msgid ""
"Could it have something to do with her outfit? Or maybe she\r\n"
"didn't get enough training in..."
msgstr ""
"Potrebbe dipendere dal suo outfit? O forse ha bisogno di più "
"addestramento..."

msgctxt "972"
msgid ""
"In any case, everyone worked hard today. Let's do our best\r\n"
"to get another rank promotion."
msgstr ""
"In ogni caso, oggi tutte hanno lavorato sodo. Facciamo del nostro meglio per"
" salire nuovamente di rango."

msgctxt "1008"
msgid "Kiryu-san, %s-san's rank went up!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1020"
msgid ""
"I can tell you've both been putting a lot into it. Keep up\r\n"
"the excellent work!"
msgstr "Si vede che vi state impegnando molto entrambi. Continuate così!"

msgctxt "1032"
msgid "Great work today! Let's aim for the next milestone!"
msgstr "Ottimo lavoro oggi! Puntiamo al prossimo traguardo!"

msgctxt "1056"
msgid "Great hustle out there, Kiryu-san!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1068"
msgid "Come help us out again sometime!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1092"
msgid "I haven't seen %s-san all morning... Looks like it's a no-show."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1104"
msgid "I would think she'd at least give us a call..."
msgstr "Pensavo che almeno ci avrebbe chiamato..."

